    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper class for dealing with a scalar element at the end of a record. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This has a separate implementation because up until now we&apos;ve only been <emphasis>building</emphasis> the record (into a data buffer), and now we need to hand it off to the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_bitstream_writer" kindref="compound">BitstreamWriter</ref> to be emitted.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_b_c_record_layout" kindref="compound">BCRecordLayout</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
